Z||000009||pherder||01-23-2000||11:11 PM||||Ahh!  Batboy!<P>Cruised your web pages.  Thanks for the clue on how to find your pictures. ;^)<P>And for coming down and helping, COME ON DOWN!<P>I have three re-engine projects ... the 88 Coupe w/HO Quad 4, my new (to me as of Monday!!!)88 GT with a 3.1 to be installed, and the TPI V8 to go into my 88 Formula and then to put the PISA Artero body kit on the spaceframe!  (and for next week ...)<P>And yes!!! I have one of each model Fiero that Pontiac sold in 1988!  And not a single one of them will end up with a stock engine!<P>And since I parted out an 88 Formula that the spaceframe was totally rusted out, I have the suspension from that Formula on the Coupe.  I could swap the rear cradles from one car to the other depending on what kind of power I wanted in what car! ;^)<P>Paul||||reg||10
